      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ترهّل</span></b>  <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, soft in the flesh:</i>
and <i>it</i> (the flesh of a limb or member) <i>was,</i> or
<i>became, soft.</i> (KL.) [See also 1.]

